AR","key":"FXtH9obqS2"}],"key":"X9zDf9SjeO"},{"type":"text","value":") platform supports an enhanced understanding of changes occurring on Earth through time. Data from the ","key":"wKbIqrnYFx"},{"type":"abbreviation","title":"NASA-ISRO Synthetic Aperture Radar","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NISAR","key":"jX2WCw14JA"}],"key":"ATBAHvN8l2"},{"type":"text","value":" mission can be used to monitor ecosystems, ice masses, vegetation biomass, sea level, groundwater dynamics, geophysical processes, and natural hazards.","key":"nHWFHKJKw4"}],"key":"qku3amQM6g"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"abbreviation","title":"NASA-ISRO Synthetic Aperture Radar","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NISAR","key":"IMS30TKYfq"}],"key":"b7tWjmMpgb"},{"type":"text","value":"’s dual-band radar systematically images the Earth’s surface, regardless of light or cloud conditions, and can measure surface deformation on the centimeter scale.","key":"Uk4toEJbJX"}],"key":"pu42W6FqFK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"All ","key":"EHjdRKybH0"},{"type":"abbreviation","title":"NASA-ISRO Synthetic Aperture Radar","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NISAR","key":"T2J9HIL8wi"}],"key":"zfOtz8kEZN"},{"type":"text","value":" science data is freely available and open to the public, consistent with the long-standing NASA Earth Science open data policy.","key":"VyZ0HJgVp6"}],"key":"aRfQZ1D06O"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This guide aims to help those who research and monitor the Earth find all the information they need to know about accessing and working with ","key":"jSwFYCdtKk"},{"type":"abbreviation","title":"NASA-ISRO Synthetic Aperture Radar","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NISAR","key":"etSP7ejhcq"}],"key":"hCn6VllHaA"},{"type"